## Kiến trúc sau refactor

```
GitHub Push → CI detects changed service → Build image:sha → Update values.yaml → Push
                                                                          ↓
ArgoCD detects values.yaml change → Sync App → Argo Rollouts starts canary
                                                          ↓
                              Istio VirtualService (100% stable → gradually shift to canary)
                                                          ↓
                              RL Agent analyzes metrics → Promote or Rollback
```
